# Sync OpenAPI docs

After editing routes, schemas, OpenAPI config, services, or API errors under `src/`:

1. Run from repo root: `npm run openapi:sync`
2. Commit any changes under:
   - `apps/docs/openapi/openapi.json`
   - `apps/docs/content/docs/api/`
3. Run `npm run build:docs` to verify.

Do not hand-edit generated `apps/docs/content/docs/api/*.mdx` files.

Full agent workflow: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Deployment: [docs/vercel-deploy.md](../../docs/vercel-deploy.md).
